===========================================================
SECURITY
===========================================================

The API Gateway already validates JWT.

The API Gateway injects

X-User-Id

X-User-Email

X-User-Role

X-User-Authorities

The HeaderAuthenticationFilter converts these trusted headers into a UserPrincipal.

Controllers MUST NOT read HTTP headers directly.

Controllers MUST ONLY use

@AuthenticationPrincipal UserPrincipal

The Service layer must receive the authenticated user's ID from the controller.

Never trust any client supplied ID.

